½-an-hour to remove him. He lay bleeding for almost 2½ hours before a veterinarian appeared to help him. His rider, " [:a {:href "/athletes/11580"} "Poul Erik Bæk"] ", tenderly placed the horse’s head on his saddle, and he and spectators covered Rolf II with a blanket and gave him ice cubes while they waited."] "\n\n" [:p {} "This was better than what happened to the Romanian horse " [:a {:href "/horses/1725"} "Mures II"] ", who somehow finished the course despite a fatal injury, dying shortly after he crossed the line, but the OCOG did not have this contingency planned for and Mures II lay there for hours before he was removed."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In this setting the results of the competition become secondary. It was won by Australia’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/12454"} "Lawrence Morgan"] ", with the silver going to his teammate " [:a {:href "/athletes/12290"} "Neale Lavis"] "."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "Horse"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12454"} "Laurie Morgan"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/2195"} "Salad Days"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUS.png"}] "AUS"]] [:td {} "7.15"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12290"} "Neale Lavis"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/1654"} "Mirrabooka"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUS.png"}] "AUS"]] [:td {} "-16.50"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} 